>
  <article class="ed-article" data-template="editorial">
    <div class="ed-col">
      <nav class="ed-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/best-of/">Best Lists</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <span>Ownership</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Treadmill Maintenance Cost</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Routine upkeep costs $15 to $40 a year and takes under an hour. The failures it prevents cost several hundred dollars each. That ratio is the entire argument, and most owners never hear it.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
